{"root":{"data":{"id":"dm3dp068im00","created":1791860949410,"text":"支付差异均摊机制"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm3dp8px73k0","created":1791860968015,"text":"报价预付款"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm3dsenxx4o0","created":1791861216048,"text":"通常一次付清，且通常为HKD付款，一般差异较小"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm3dp98fop40","created":1791860969134,"text":"PO正式付款"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm3dv1tdsrs0","created":1791861423172,"text":"本地银行/FPS"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm3dynwc9u00","created":1791861706332,"text":"HKD付款，一般差额在2HKD以内，通常不会达到均摊标准0.01HKD"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm3dvbmwabc0","created":1791861444547,"text":"海外付款"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dm3dzdrijcg0","created":1791861762637,"text":"汇率问题，可能导致在Airwallex实际付款多了或者少了，正常均摊到成本里即可"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm3e2qjnawo0","created":1791862025552,"text":"手续费，部分地区需要支付手续费，要把手续费均摊到成本里"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dm3e4yquyiw0","created":1791862200130,"text":"订单金额有改动或与invoice不符，一般是因为当时换\n算到单个产品的成本是以HKD计算的，最后算出来的\n总额和支付的金额不一致"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm3dzksr9800","created":1791861777949,"text":"台湾付款"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dm3dp9bdk7k0","created":1791860969312,"text":"PO超限付款"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}